exports[`buildPrompt byte-stability snapshot > is byte-identical across two calls (empty body branch, frozen registry) > frozen-empty-body-catalog 1`] = `
"Available block types (use ONLY these):
- mj-button: leaf, text-content, attrs=[href, background-color, color], defaults={"background-color":"#1f6feb","color":"#ffffff","href":"#"}
- mj-section: container, children=[mj-column], attrs=[background-color, padding], defaults={"background-color":"#ffffff","padding":"20px 0"}

The current template is empty. Create a new email template using only the blocks listed above and the user's request. Use the structural example below as a starting point.

<mjml>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://placehold.co/600x300" alt="Hero" />
        <mj-text font-size="24px" font-weight="bold">Welcome</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Replace this text with your content.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://example.com">Get Started</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
"
`;

